# Workspace Indexing Exclusions
# Prevents Gemini CLI from scanning build artifacts, dependency directories, and IDE caches

# IDE & Editor Caches
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.vscode-shared/

# .NET Build Artifacts & Binaries
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Debug/
**/Release/
**/TestResults/

# JavaScript, TypeScript & Deno Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.deno/

# Python Tooling & Test Caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Ephemeral Traces, Dumps & Logs
**/.gemini/tmp/
**/*.log
**/*.har
**/*.tmp

# OS & Environment Files
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
